  "plain": "UFOs are said to have crashed in New Mexico in the 1940s, at Trinity, the site of the first atomic bomb test, and at Roswell, a town in the same state. Michels mentions these in passing as \"known crashes\" on a 2022 episode with the Harvard astronomer Avi Loeb. He names no source, and he treats them as background rather than telling either one in full."
